              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Ekintu kino kinaabeeranga etteeka ery'ebiro byonna okuyita mu mirembe eginaagendanga giddiriragana mu bifo byonna gye munaabeeranga. Temulyanga masavu wadde omusaayi.' \"",
